anagement","s":"Bryan B. DeBoer","x":"I would say this also, opportunities in cost savings come through improving sales volumes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/13/lithia-motors-inc-lad-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"LAD 2019 Q1","e":"lad","d":"2019-04-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Holzshu","x":"Cost-savings initiatives are gaining traction as the results in the quarter indicated.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/24/lithia-motors-lad-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LAD 2019 Q2","e":"lad","d":"2019-07-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Holzshu","x":"Our teams have made progress on cost savings efforts and continue to focus on personnel, advertising and facility costs, which make up over 85% of SG&A. Lithia's unique operating model leverages our employees to make decisions closest to our customers, allowing us to react quickly to market…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/24/lithia-motors-lad-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LAD 2019 Q3","e":"lad","d":"2019-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Holzshu","x":"Our teams continue to make progress on cost saving efforts and focus on personnel, advertising and facility costs which make up the majority of SG&A, considering over half of our stores are still unseasoned, significant opportunity to drive down our industry-leading leverage remains.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/lithia-motors-lad-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LAD 2020 Q1","e":"lad","d":"2020-04-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Rajat Gupta","x":"I'll pass it on and jump back in queue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/22/lithia-motors-lad-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LAD 2020 Q1","e":"lad","d":"2020-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Holzshu","x":"Store leaders have taken prudent and decisive cost-saving measures in personnel and advertising expenses, which is comprised of 75% of our SG&A. Our marketing teams are identifying the advertising channels and messages that provide the most efficient investment on our advertising dollars.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/22/lithia-motors-lad-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LAD 2020 Q1","e":"lad","d":"2020-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Holzshu","x":"As you remember, coming off of Q4, we were already talking about kind of a rightsizing effort to kind of regroup in each one of our stores and go back to the foundation of the productivity metrics that we've had since really the last recession.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/22/lithia-motors-lad-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LAD 2020 Q2","e":"lad","d":"2020-07-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Holzshu","x":"Store leaders continue to take prudent and decisive cost savings measures in personnel and advertising expenses, which comprise approximately 75% of our SG&A. These actions led the significant sequential improvements throughout the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/22/lithia-motors-inc-lad-q2-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"LAD 2020 Q3","e":"lad","d":"2020-10-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan B. DeBoer","x":"These record gross profit levels coupled with sequential improvements in all business lines and strategic cost saving measures executed earlier this year allowed us to eclipse a $0.25 billion of adjusted EBITDA in the third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/21/lithia-motors-inc-lad-q3-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"LAD 2020 Q3","e":"lad","d":"2020-10-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Holzshu","x":"The decisive cost saving measures taken earlier in the year continue to take hold and are expected to continue into 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/21/lithia-motors-inc-lad-q3-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"LAD 2020 Q4","e":"lad","d":"2021-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan DeBoer","x":"These elevated gross profit levels in new vehicles, coupled with higher performing new acquisitions, improvements in all business lines and strategic cost saving measures executed last year led us to earning over $750 million in adjusted EBITDA for 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/lithia-motors-inc-lad-q4-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"LAD 2021 Q1","e":"lad","d":"2021-04-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"David Whiston","x":"…do you see a scenario where 2022, given the low inventory we had for a long time now, plus a very high consumer demand, 2022 start to possibly just explode upward and really do you want to get a lot more inventory or would you -- do you like the high-pricing power environment you have now?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/21/lithia-motors-inc-lad-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"LAD 2021 Q1","e":"lad","d":"2021-04-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan DeBoer","x":"…new and used vehicles, rapid integration of high-performing acquisitions, incremental lift from the new Driveway channel, significant improvements in all business lines, and strategic cost savings measures instituted last year led us to earning over $250 million of adjusted EBITDA in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/21/lithia-motors-inc-lad-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"LAD 2021 Q2","e":"lad","d":"2021-07-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher S. Holzshu","x":"While we expect SG&A to gross profit to normalize as new vehicle supply and gross margins bounce back to historical levels, we continue to benefit from the permanent headcount reductions of 20% or almost 300 basis points of SG&A, and other efficiency measures implemented last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/21/lithia-motors-inc-lad-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"LAD 2021 Q2","e":"lad","d":"2021-07-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan B. DeBoer","x":"We do share best practices, and hopefully overtime, they are able to take some of the cost out of their traditional model.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/21/lithia-motors-inc-lad-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"LAD 2021 Q3","e":"lad","d":"2021-10-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Chris Bottiglieri","x":"And then, secondly, if I heard you correctly, it sounds like you're becoming more confident on the level of structural cost takeout.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/20/lithia-motors-inc-lad-q3-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"LAD 2021 Q4","e":"lad","d":"2022-02-09","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"John Murphy","x":"But it looks like they're trying to, with your help, replicate the direct-to-consumer model in some form or fashion, which you're already doing yourselves, in some ways sort of the online efforts that look similar to that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/10/lithia-motors-lad-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2021 Q4","e":"lad","d":"2022-02-09","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Bryan DeBoer","x":"And a lot of the discussions that are out there aren't really factual as who's going DTC.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/10/lithia-motors-lad-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2021 Q4","e":"lad","d":"2022-02-09","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Bryan DeBoer","x":"Outside of that, there isn't a DTC, OK?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/10/lithia-motors-lad-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2022 Q1","e":"lad","d":"2022-04-20","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"David Whiston","x":"And then on shifting gears over to the continued growth of Tesla that their direct-to-consumer model, I'm just curious if your either your premium brands or any of your brand stores are getting hurt at all by Tesla's growth and if not, would there be if there was no chip shortage impacting…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/26/lithia-motors-lad-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2022 Q1","e":"lad","d":"2022-04-20","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Bryan DeBoer","x":"So we think that the DTC model is how we mirrored Driveway and GreenCars experiences.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/26/lithia-motors-lad-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2022 Q1","e":"lad","d":"2022-04-20","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Bryan DeBoer","x":"And I think maybe even more important in terms of the DTC, we are very well aligned with our manufacturer partners from a Tier 1 and Tier 3 level in marketing and from consumer experience from factory to Driveway, that is the right answer for the consumers that will ultimately drive market share…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/26/lithia-motors-lad-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2022 Q1","e":"lad","d":"2022-04-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Chris Bottiglieri","x":"I guess, like, to-date have you seen any lenders on average, if you see lenders begin to pass through some of the funding cost to customers yet and if so, how much on average?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/26/lithia-motors-lad-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2022 Q2","e":"lad","d":"2022-07-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Chuck Lietz","x":"As Bryan indicated earlier, we are reaffirming our guidance of the future state expectation that DFC will contribute $650 million in earnings to Lithia and Driveway.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/20/lithia-motors-lad-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2025 Q2","e":"lad","d":"2025-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Bryan DeBoer","x":"We continue to monitor and respond to the evolving tariff landscape and broader consumer trends.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/lithia-lad-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2025 Q2","e":"lad","d":"2025-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Jordan","x":"And then did you benefit in after sales from any tariff-related inflation pass through during the quarter?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/lithia-lad-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2025 Q2","e":"lad","d":"2025-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Jeff Flick","x":"You know, when we talk if we assume that a 15% tariff unit like a car is, you know, 85%, 87%, whatever cost is probably gonna be where we end up just across the board, you know, the price increase required, you know, at the at the invoice level, the OEM invoice level is pretty substantial.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/lithia-lad-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2025 Q2","e":"lad","d":"2025-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Ron Joseko","x":"I guess, any way to think about the cost savings potential for some of the things you laid out, performance management, tech stack, vendor contracts, automating workflows, and then The UK.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/lithia-lad-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2025 Q2","e":"lad","d":"2025-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Bryan DeBoer","x":"When ultimately you still have to force the cost savings, and we're encouraging our store leaders and our department leaders to do such.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/lithia-lad-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2025 Q2","e":"lad","d":"2025-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tina Miller","x":"As we look at the rest of the year, you know, we did increase the outlook slightly as we think about SG and A just sort of balancing what's already occurred in the first half with continued discipline in the second half.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/lithia-lad-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2025 Q4","e":"lad","d":"2026-02-11","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Tina H. Miller","x":"…raising productivity through performance management and technology solutions, including early investments in AI-powered chatbots and customer service automation; simplifying the tech stack and retiring redundant systems; renegotiating vendor contracts at scale; and automating back-office…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/lithia-motors-lad-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2025 Q4","e":"lad","d":"2026-02-11","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Tina H. Miller","x":"These efforts are building momentum quarter by quarter with benefits from our Pinewood AI investments expected to materialize over time as we scale deployment and realize efficiency gains.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/lithia-motors-lad-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2025 Q4","e":"lad","d":"2026-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Bryan B. DeBoer","x":"This quarter, GPU compression outpaced our cost reduction efforts Tina will talk to in just a moment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/lithia-motors-lad-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2026 Q1","e":"lad","d":"2026-04-29","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Bryan DeBoer","x":"New vehicle revenue declined 7.1% on a 7.1% decline in units, which reflected the challenging comparison to the first quarter of 2025 due to tariff avoidance pull forward last March.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/lithia-lad-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2026 Q1","e":"lad","d":"2026-04-29","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Bryan DeBoer","x":"But I also know that if the war can come down and if tariffs can gain some clarity, and it's a matter of things can fall in the line that we can through this and hopefully have a decent second half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/lithia-lad-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2026 Q1","e":"lad","d":"2026-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Christopher Bottiglieri","x":"Is that a DMS or what does that implicate for future cost savings?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/lithia-lad-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2026 Q2","e":"lad","d":"2026-07-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bryan DeBoer","x":"We know what's happening with Pinewood.AI as an investment, let alone what it's going to do for us on a foundational aspect to our cost controls.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/lithia-motors-lad-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2026 Q2","e":"lad","d":"2026-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bryan DeBoer","x":"New vehicle revenue declined 1.5% on 2.2% lower units, solid performance against a demanding comparison to last year's Q2 tariff pull-forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/lithia-motors-lad-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2026 Q2","e":"lad","d":"2026-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"John Babcock","x":"And then just as a quick follow-on to that, and I'll then pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/lithia-motors-lad-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAD 2026 Q2","e":"lad","d":"2026-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan DeBoer","x":"The power of Pinewood's technology and AI bring a potential 10x scale multiplier to Lithia & Driveway's global cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/lithia-motors-lad